red,\n              mRestrictBackground, mRestrictBackground,\n              lockdownCaps.first, lockdownCaps.seconfd,\n              vpnCaps.first, vpnCaps.second);\n    }\n  }\n\n\n\nWDYT ?\n\n(I\u0027m happy with your current code BTW, it\u0027s just a suggestion)",
